{"id":"60152252105eae25","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-regex-syntax.md","title":"Regular Expression Syntax","display":"df-regular-expression-syntax — Regular Expression Syntax","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-regex-syntax","aliases":["73-df-regex-syntax","73-df-regular-expression-syntax"],"display":"df-regular-expression-syntax — Regular Expression Syntax","depends_on":["[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§3.1–3.2, print pp. 84–107; PDF pp. 106–129; separated syntax/denotation formalization","source_status":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","legacy_source_id":"HU1979","legacy_source_ref":"§2.5, Theorems 2.3–2.4, pp. 28–36; local separated syntax and language algebra","legacy_source_status":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":3},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-regex-syntax"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-regex-syntax</span><span>73-df-regular-expression-syntax</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-regular-expression-syntax — Regular Expression Syntax"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§3.1–3.2, print pp. 84–107; PDF pp. 106–129; separated syntax/denotation formalization"},{"key":"source_status","html":"third-edition-topic-mapped; inherited-local-review; not-a-line-by-line-source-proof-certificate"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"§2.5, Theorems 2.3–2.4, pp. 28–36; local separated syntax and language algebra"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"local-formalization; source-section-located; proof scope recorded in review"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"3"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>固定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma\">\\(\\Sigma\\)</span> 满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0a6da8c909717780\" href=\"?note=0a6da8c909717780\" title=\"73-df-finite-words-and-languages\">73-df-finite-words-and-languages</a>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是固定的背景项载集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\in\\mathcal U\">\\(\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\in\\mathcal U\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(a\\mapsto\\mathbf a):\\Sigma\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\((a\\mapsto\\mathbf a):\\Sigma\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>；原构造子具有类型 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"+:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\(+:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cdot:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\(\\cdot:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"(E\\mapsto E^\\star):\\mathcal U\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\">\\((E\\mapsto E^\\star):\\mathcal U\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U\\)</span>，并把该一元构造子记为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\star\">\\(\\star\\)</span>。它们是语法构造子，不是语言并、语言连接或算术运算。</li>\n<li>构造子的分离假设为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf0\\ne\\mathbf1\">\\(\\mathbf0\\ne\\mathbf1\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cap\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}=\\varnothing\">\\(\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cap\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}=\\varnothing\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigl(\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\bigr)\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)\\bigr)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\bigl(\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\bigr)\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)\\bigr)=\\varnothing\\)</span>，以及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)=\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)=\\varnothing\">\\(\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)=\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)=\\varnothing\\)</span>。单射性已包含在上列构造子类型中。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\">\\(S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\)</span> 是候选项集合；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(n\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 的定义不预设封闭性；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\">\\(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\)</span> 在 Assertion 中构造。固定环境中的构造子及项对象沿用原接口，不另选具体标签编码。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\mathbf0\\in S\\land\\mathbf1\\in S\n\\land(\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\mathbf a\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall E,F\\in S\\;((E+F)\\in S\\land(E\\cdot F)\\in S))\n\\land(\\forall E\\in S\\;E^\\star\\in S)\\Bigr]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}(S)\\leftrightarrow\n\\Bigl[\\mathbf0\\in S\\land\\mathbf1\\in S\n\\land(\\forall a\\in\\Sigma\\;\\mathbf a\\in S)\n\\land(\\forall E,F\\in S\\;((E+F)\\in S\\land(E\\cdot F)\\in S))\n\\land(\\forall E\\in S\\;E^\\star\\in S)\\Bigr]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(0)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}:\\mathbb N\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathcal U),\\qquad\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(0)\\coloneqq\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n+1)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\n\\cup\\{E+F:E,F\\in\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{E\\cdot F:E,F\\in\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{E^\\star:E\\in\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n+1)\\coloneqq\n\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\n\\cup\\{E+F:E,F\\in\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{E\\cdot F:E,F\\in\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\}\n\\cup\\{E^\\star:E\\in\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\coloneqq\\bigcup_{n\\in\\mathbb N}\\operatorname{REStage}_{\\Sigma}(n)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n(\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}(S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}regular\\text{-}expression\\text{-}syntax}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})\n\\land\\bigl(\\forall S\\subseteq\\mathcal U\\;\n(\\operatorname{REClosed}_{\\Sigma}(S)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}\\subseteq S)\\bigr)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>有限层构造只使用已经给定的全构造子；其并集是原构造子生成的最小封闭项集。背景载集即使含有额外对象，也不会把它们加入该项集。构造子的类型、单射性和互斥性全部在 Hypothesis 中给出，后续语义递归不再依赖 Remark 中的“通常有限项构造”。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-words-and-languages","status":"resolved","id":"0a6da8c909717780","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"固定 $\\Sigma$ 满足 $\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)$，见 [[73-df-finite-words-and-languages]]。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Alphabet}(\\Sigma)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\in\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"(a\\mapsto\\mathbf a):\\Sigma\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"+:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\cdot:\\mathcal U^2\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"(E\\mapsto E^\\star):\\mathcal U\\hookrightarrow\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"\\star","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathbf0\\ne\\mathbf1","display":false},{"tex":"\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cap\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigl(\\{\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1\\}\\cup\\{\\mathbf a:a\\in\\Sigma\\}\\bigr)\\cap\\bigl(\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)\\cup\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)\\bigr)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)=\\operatorname{ran}(+)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)=\\operatorname{ran}(\\cdot)\\cap\\operatorname{ran}(\\star)=\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"S\\subseteq\\mathcal U","display":false},{"tex":"n\\in\\mathbb N","display":f