造子 $\\mathbf0,\\mathbf1,\\mathbf a,+,\\cdot,\\star$ 取 [[73-df-regex-syntax]] 的同一实例。$U\\in(\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma})^{<\\omega}$，$E\\in\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}$，$i,j\\in Q$，$k\\in\\{0,\\ldots,n-1\\}$，$\\ell\\in\\{0,\\ldots,m-1\\}$。"},{"id":"d47feb8e4b903a2e","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathsf{RegExp}_{\\Sigma}$ (regular-expression term set, see [[73-df-regex-syntax]])"},{"id":"0d09e544c417402c","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-43","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-regex-syntax|Regular Expression Syntax]]"}],"outgoing":["0a6da8c909717780"]}